# Widgets Package
# iOS WidgetKit and Android Glance widget implementations
#
# iOS Widgets:
# - MoodWidget — Quick check-in, shows current state
# - HabitsWidget — Today's habits with checkboxes
# - CaptureWidget — One-tap to capture thought
# - EnergyWidget — Current energy level + prediction
# - QuoteWidget — Daily journal prompt
#
# Android Widgets:
# - Same functionality via Jetpack Glance
# - Home screen shortcuts for voice capture
